Z||000000||Jaei Sun||04-11-2001||01:14 AM||||I found these in the junkyard... backup lights from some old GM (can't remember exactly what make).  They're pretty close in design to the original ambers.  I had to do a little modifyin to make them mount in.  I picked up some "hyper-white" turn-signals and it looks sweet at night~!<P> <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/Nose.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/Nose_on.jpg"> <P>Now I just need some sidemarkers to modify with clear lenses to match.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/trans_fiero_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
