Z||000006||sqoach||04-11-2001||10:08 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Phil:<BR><B>Are white turn signals legal for our year cars?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I was wondering that too. When I bought my fog lights, I was going to put them in the front turn signal holes. But my dad told me it's illegal to do that, you need to be able to see the orange from the front and the side. Now all these new cars have just one on the corner. Someone needs to come up with some kind of corner-mount turn signal.<P><P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach2.JPG">  <BR>84 SE (project car?)<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)<BR>86 SC (daily overheating)||||reg||1
