Z||000008||Mr.Frosty||04-11-2001||02:38 PM||||I've been pondering this one for awhile,and I decided to go with side marker lights like off of a Passat or Golf,and black out and fill in the original trim marker lights,but they are dished on the back,so I went with universal side markers from the local custom auto shop.I'm wiring them off of the original lights.They will be clear and will use those little bulbs from the local auto parts store.So I can change the color to whatever I feel like.I'll try to get picks whenever I get my D.camera<P>------------------<BR>88 Formula T-top <BR>85 GT Turbo||||reg||10
